WEBVTT

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.450
What'll it be?

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.490
Make it a strawberry sundae.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.410
Sir...

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:40.660
This is a bar. It's no place for a kid.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:41.660
Oh?

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.280
Then I'd expect to smell more alcohol,

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:46.820
but the smell of blood is
what's assaulting my nose here.

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:50.280
Well, that's fine with me...

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.590
What I'm interested in is
this strange rumor I heard.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:57.560
They say that somewhere around
here there's some outdated, violent bar.

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:00.990
A place where they'll take
someone's life in place of money.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.750
It's pretty scary.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:07.490
Forgive me.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:10.280
Royal Straight Flush, is it?

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:13.200
Laying a hand like that
will shorten a person's life.

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:16.360
How about I buy you a round!

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:49.870
Not bad, Mr. Royal Straight Flush.

00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:19.430
The next time you open up shop,

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.830
don't forget to add
strawberry sundaes to the menu.

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:33.730
Bingo.

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.030
Yeah, my usual pizza.

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:06.200
The special mix with fresh ham
and garlic potatoes. Rush delivery.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:08.180
What, my tab?

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:10.920
Don't sweat the small stuff.

00:03:11.310 --> 00:03:13.990
Soon, I'll pay you in one
fell swoop for everything.

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:17.960
No olives. A large. Don't forget.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.270
Are you listening to me, Dante?

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:25.650
Didn't you hear me? I'm studying.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:31.150
I may be a man who does odd jobs,
but I have no desire to baby-sit some brat.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:33.200
--Brat?
--Sorry, young lady.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:38.340
In about 10 years or so,
I'll ask you out on a date.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.570
And I'll tell you "no" in about 10 seconds.

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:44.520
Me, I'm into younger guys.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:50.630
Listen, Dante. She may be a kid, but...

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.100
Oops... My apologies.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:56.090
She is not just any girl.
She's Patty Lowell...

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:59.390
The Cinderella girl who is
heiress to the Lowell family fortune.

00:03:59.390 --> 00:04:02.240
She sure doesn't look it.

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:05.610
That's because all this time she's
been living as an orphan downtown.

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:09.950
I see. Like Cinderella
after the magic wore off.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:11.720
Actually, it's the opposite.

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:14.620
The other day, the head of
the Lowell family passed away.

00:04:15.610 --> 00:04:19.630
When the will was read, an illegitimate
child came to light. The lucky winner was...

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:21.670
...our young lady, Patty?

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:25.700
Precisely. In other words,
the magic is just about to begin.

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:29.250
If you like, I could always
hire you as my servant...

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:30.220
Whatever.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:35.080
Basically, it has been
requested that you escort Miss Patty

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:38.540
back to the Lowell Mansion
by 6:00pm tomorrow.

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.240
--That's all?
--That's all.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:44.130
I won't do it. I've got a pizza on the way...

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.770
There's no pizza on the way.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:48.140
I stopped by and talked with Andy
at the pizza place and told him

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:52.210
that until you pay your tab in full, they are
not to deliver a single pizza to you. Capisci?

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.650
You bastard. What right do you have to...

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.530
Shit... again?

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:03.640
If you win, I'll pay your
tab in full. And if you lose...

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.100
Fine, I got it.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:06.800
Heads.

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:10.770
You're not much of a gambler, are you?

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:11.830
Shut up.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:13.760
Dante.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:16.830
You forget something?
You've got a show to play, right?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.360
A show?

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:22.580
I'm counting on you.

00:05:29.460 --> 00:05:31.990
I could come and see your show...

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:35.320
I mean, there must not be anyone
who comes to see you otherwise, right?

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:38.740
Sorry, but my shows are adults only.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:42.300
So the woman in that picture is
coming to your show then, huh?

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:43.040
Picture?

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:52.760
Well, whatever you do, you
should buy yourself a new car.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:55.600
I don't see any romance
happening in this car, that's for sure.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.610
It's dirty, it stinks,
and it's falling apart.

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:02.900
Listen, when it comes to women, it's not
where you take them that's important.

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:06.390
It's how you get them there.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:10.950
Dante.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:14.870
This girl's life is mine!

00:06:16.820 --> 00:06:18.710
Hey! Are you even listening to me?!

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.950
What are you doing?!

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.920
What was that all about?!

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:40.400
Don't you think that's a little
dangerous?! What if I died?

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:49.080
Can't you do something about this,
bro? You are a lawyer, aren't you?!

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.010
There's nothing that can be done!

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:55.030
If the person who sent that letter,
Patty Lowell, actually does exist,

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.890
the fortune belongs to her.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.100
You're kidding me!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.240
Take it easy, big bro.

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.700
If that letter isn't a fake,

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:06.780
then Patty Lowell will come here
around six o'clock tomorrow evening.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.630
That's what I'm worried about!

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:12.170
Tomorrow at six in the evening...
That makes exactly one week, doesn't it?!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.710
"If Patty Lowell's existence is proven

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:19.040
within one week of the death
of the Lowell family's head,

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:22.690
the entirety of the family
fortune is to go to her," eh?

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:28.130
Unbelievable... To think our ever-so-serious
other had an illegitimate child all this time...

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:44.080
Huh. So you can look pretty, too.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.700
Is that a picture of some boy?

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.630
It's my mom!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:51.160
And she's a lot prettier
than your girlfriend!

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:56.860
But... I don't remember anything about her...

00:07:57.650 --> 00:08:02.170
My mom got sick and
died when I was just a baby.

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.950
That's what the director
of the orphanage said.

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:09.120
That's why I don't remember
anything about my mother...

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:12.490
The only thing I have is
this picture of her...

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.230
Wow! She's beautiful!

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.910
Is that a picture of your mother?

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:23.600
Hey, and you're pretty charming yourself!

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:26.370
Mind if I sit here?

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:26.870
Huh?

00:08:27.830 --> 00:08:28.810
There are open seats all
over the place, aren't there?

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:32.520
--Here you go!
--Thank you!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:35.680
I hope I am not bothering you.

00:08:36.090 --> 00:08:38.840
It's no bother. But I can't
promise you that you'll live long.

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:41.100
What is that supposed to mean?!

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:45.610
Really!

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:48.810
Why would anyone need some
promise like that, just because they sit...

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:56.580
Good grief. That's why I told you...

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:14.330
He's dead.

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.810
Mom... Mom...

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:23.160
Looks like he was beaten to death.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.500
It can't be! Was it you?!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.640
Over here!

00:09:27.980 --> 00:09:29.590
What is this?!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:33.190
Hey, you. Why don't you
tell me what's going on?

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:36.900
Sure, how's this...

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:42.020
For the ten-odd seconds or so
that this train was in the tunnel,

00:09:42.020 --> 00:09:46.540
in this car there were
those three, me and the girl.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:50.140
And then our dead friend
here. That makes six.

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:52.850
First off, the old man. He didn't do it.

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:56.380
And the couple there
was making out in the dark.

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:58.140
You can see for yourself how the girl is.

00:09:58.140 --> 00:09:59.790
That only leaves you...

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.620
No, there was one more person.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:04.460
Or to be more precise, one more thing.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:49.490
Who killed that guy?

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:50.800
Who knows...

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:53.320
It was a devil.

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:55.640
He was killed by a devil, wasn't he?

00:10:56.330 --> 00:11:00.100
Could... Could a devil be hunting me, too?

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:02.750
Dante!

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:05.340
Let's go.

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:10.740
Checkmate.

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:13.360
Damn. I lost again!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:16.450
Ever since we were kids, you've always
run out of steam in the closing stretch.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:19.350
That's why Jenny left you.

00:11:19.350 --> 00:11:21.060
It's because you got in the way!

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:25.300
No, that was because you were
at fault for jumping to conclusions.

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:26.270
Shit.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:30.560
At any rate... You sure do
love that painting, don't you?

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:34.520
Yes. I guess it's because
looking at it puts me at peace.

00:11:34.520 --> 00:11:38.740
I know, when we divide the fortune
among us, I'll take the artwork that's here.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:41.060
Me, I'll take cold, hard cash.

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:42.620
Hey! Don't get ahead of yourselves!

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:47.420
We know. But we have to
be prepared for the worst...

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:49.460
That's all we're doing...

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:52.330
Welcome.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.490
Give me your cheapest room.

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:56.700
I don't give a damn if it gets sun or not.

00:11:56.700 --> 00:11:58.750
Because we'll be out of here
first thing in the morning anyhow.

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:02.090
One adult and one child.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:05.010
She's not a child. She's a young lady.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.890
What're you doing? Come on,
let's get to sleep right away.

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:11.480
--Mom.
--What?

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.940
Mom!

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:15.310
Mister!

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:17.110
Yes? What is it?

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:19.570
Where can I go to meet this woman?

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:23.480
Come on, your mother supposedly died, right?

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:24.440
Come on.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:37.260
Shit. These beds really are small.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:40.640
You, too. Get to bed.
Tomorrow's going to be an early day.

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:45.670
My mom... she didn't
actually get sick and die.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.300
She disappeared.

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:51.420
I happened to overhear the director
of the orphanage talking about it.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:54.700
My mom was being hunted by a devil.

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:57.320
And she didn't want me,
a baby, to be in danger,

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.700
so she put me in the care of the orphanage.

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:03.160
Is anyone hunted by a devil as good as dead?!

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:05.200
Is my mom dead?!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.040
Am I going to be killed
by a devil too, then?!

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:09.720
Who knows...

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:19.580
Me, I don't care about
any fortune or inheritance...

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.960
If I were to get a little money,
I'd just want to use it to buy lots of

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:27.850
clothes and sweets and stuff like
that for the other kids at the orphanage.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:34.720
But, clothes and sweets
aren't what they all want.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.850
Like me, they just want to see
their mothers and their fathers!

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:39.850
More than anything.

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:44.550
You're probably just going to laugh at me...

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:45.590
Nope.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.590
Everyone wants to see their parents.

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:50.300
Dante...

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:55.790
Well, sorry, but I've got a hot date
with some pretty girls in Sandman Land...

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:57.280
You get some sleep, too.

00:13:57.280 --> 00:13:58.210
Okay.

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:30.690
Hey! Where's my daughter?!

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:31.610
Daughter?

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:33.250
The kid I checked in together with!

00:14:33.610 --> 00:14:37.170
Hmmm... I don't know
what you're talking about, sir.

00:14:48.350 --> 00:14:49.890
You bastard, what are you?

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:55.220
Me, I know pretty much all about you.

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:59.780
Yeah, then you know that thing
won't be enough to kill me, don't you?

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:03.060
So, where is Patty?

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:05.990
Okay, fine...

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:09.500
Well, you see, right now in the demon world,

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:13.000
the four most powerful
devils are vying for power.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.370
Things are pretty dangerous.

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:16.590
Who told you to do this?

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:17.210
Huh?

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.910
Who told you to go after Patty?

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.790
It must be someone from the Lowell family...

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:27.960
Someone who doesn't want
Patty to claim the inheritance.

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:33.840
Sorry. I'm just one of their grunts.
They don't tell me anything.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.250
Mom!

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:09.290
Mom!

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:12.380
Mom! Mom!

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:15.690
Mom!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:19.110
Mom! I wanted to see you so bad!

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:20.690
I'm sorry, Patty.

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:24.230
I won't do anything to
make you feel lonely again.

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:26.450
Mom!

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:30.890
Because you're about to die right now!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.000
And your mom's going to kill you!

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:49.620
Hey there.

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:54.550
You're not actually into
lame operas like this, are you?

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:55.930
Dante!

00:16:57.640 --> 00:17:00.640
Um... I was... my mom...

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:03.570
It looks like we're going to have to
wait a bit longer for the touching finale.

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:15.400
The show to come isn't for kids.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:30.660
Miss... I'm sorry, but
now it's time for you to die.

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:38.020
It's because I was promised
I'd be rewarded if I killed you.

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:46.340
Get lost.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.470
Time's up.

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:15.280
Brother, we did it! The fortune is ours!

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.630
This letter was just a bunch of nonsense.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:20.800
You have a guest.

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:21.430
A guest?

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.550
Thank you.

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:26.640
And who might you be?

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:28.780
Oh my, that's not funny!

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:30.830
I'm Patty Lowell.

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:32.540
No! She's just a child!

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:34.630
That one's a fake.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:36.660
I took every possible situation into account.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:40.810
Luckily, I was able to find a girl
with the same name as me quite quickly.

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:44.820
I had it arranged so that all
attention would be on her.

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:47.210
Thanks to her, my trip
here was quite pleasant.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.080
Well then. Why don't we just
hurry and deal with the formalities?

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:58.170
I'm sorry, but I'm afraid your
claim is invalid, Miss Patty Lowell.

00:18:58.170 --> 00:19:02.350
Speaking as the lawyer,
I regret to inform you

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:07.300
that you have renounced your right to the
inheritance, as you missed the 6:00pm deadline.

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:10.180
Even if by just a second.

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:15.570
Really now! In his will, it says
within one week of his death.

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:21.070
I'm quite sure that my dad will have
been dead for exactly one week at 6:28.

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:24.430
And look! I am on time!

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:28.010
Will a driver's license
suffice for my identification?

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:31.080
No... It's no longer necessary.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:32.100
What do you mean by that?

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.750
Because Patty Lowell's existence...

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:38.250
will never be confirmed!

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:42.480
--Brother?!
--And neither will yours!

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:46.990
The fortune is all mine!

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.350
And I'm not handing it over to anyone!

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:04.230
So it was you?

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:07.190
That requested I serve
as a bodyguard for Patty.

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:09.910
Did you think you were making some
small atonement for your sins against her?

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:15.530
You've got a pretty face, but
you're more terrible than those devils.

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:21.800
Damn, if you were a devil, I'd be able
to kill you without a second thought.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:26.760
I need to work off some anger,
so I'm gonna let loose and unwind!

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:29.220
Guess I'll put on one hell of a big show!

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:14.740
I saw it all! The adults only part...

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:15.850
Wait!

00:21:16.410 --> 00:21:19.550
Please wait. I'm begging you.

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:23.110
That child... Please let me care for her!

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:25.730
I want to do what I can to make amends...

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:33.630
So, is it all right that you're
not staying at the mansion?

00:21:33.630 --> 00:21:35.750
It's fine. I received compensation.

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:36.720
Compensation?

00:21:36.720 --> 00:21:39.910
Yep. Because I'm a little
girl who's been scarred

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:42.510
from being exposed to the
ugly world of adults.

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:43.580
I see.

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.480
And those clothes, are
those the "compensation"?

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:48.430
Yep. As well as clothes and sweets
for the kids at the orphanage.

00:21:48.430 --> 00:21:50.470
In all, three truckloads!

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:53.240
That's great.

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:55.990
Ah, Morrison, you're here?

00:21:55.990 --> 00:21:58.230
--Yeah.
--Huh?

00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:01.910
I thought my strawberry sundae would be
delivered by the time I finished my shower...

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:03.360
That strawberry sundae?

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:07.030
That was my strawberry sundae!

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:12.010
Patty! What are you doing here?!

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.190
What... did you do to this room?

00:22:15.190 --> 00:22:20.240
It was totally filthy and dorky, so I
cleaned it and did some cute decorating.

00:22:21.220 --> 00:22:24.050
Yeah, but I'm more concerned
about my strawberry sundae...

00:22:24.050 --> 00:22:26.980
That's what I charge for my work.

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:29.070
Thanks! It was so good!

00:24:03.180 --> 00:24:08.850
What a pain... the only jobs I get
are those that don't pay anything.

00:24:09.830 --> 00:24:12.200
My debt just keeps growing...

00:24:12.650 --> 00:24:15.170
And now, I have to look
after some brat on top of it all.

00:24:16.610 --> 00:24:19.030
On nights like tonight, I like to
open up the throttle on my motorcycle

00:24:19.030 --> 00:24:21.030
and blow off some steam.

00:24:21.880 --> 00:24:24.290
And if I should cross paths
with some devil along the way...

00:24:24.290 --> 00:24:26.370
Well, that would
just make it perfect.